 "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/cb7c8bc18c943a899f7dc0f8260388ce.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/cb7c8bc18c943a899f7dc0f8260388ce.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p></p><br><h1>게임 정보</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1065e7311fde021e79b4cac1609f66ee.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/1065e7311fde021e79b4cac1609f66ee.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>‘Seaside Wash’</strong>는 몰입감 넘치는 세척 소리와 편안한 배경 음악을 조화시켜 평온하면서도 매력적인 경험을 선사합니다. 녹슬고 낡은 배들이 서서히 새것처럼 깨끗해지는 과정을 지켜보며, 작업할 때마다 성취감을 느낄 수 있습니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0064c32bed11f6cdd8ee4834dfdc1a10.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/0064c32bed11f6cdd8ee4834dfdc1a10.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >표면과 오염의 종류에 따라 필요한 도구가 다릅니다. 각 청소 작업에는 최상의 결과를 얻기 위해 적합한 장비와 방법이 필요하므로, 효율을 극대화하기 위해 신중하게 선택하십시오.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6a856c6661eac0e90d7f5e1994ae86a9.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6a856c6661eac0e90d7f5e1994ae86a9.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >도구를 업그레이드하고 수리하여 효율성을 높여, 더 까다롭지만 보람 있는 작업을 수행하세요. 복원 작업의 난이도가 높아짐에 따라 더 좋은 도구를 해금하고 작업 방식을 개선해 나가세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/3412ce03fba5ddc12f1990426e8cec94.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/3412ce03fba5ddc12f1990426e8cec94.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >작은 어선부터 거대한 화물선까지 다양한 선박을 다루게 됩니다. 각 선박은 고유한 구조와 규모를 지니고 있으며, 복원해야 할 청소 과제들이 기다리고 있습니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/37fcaa616c9bf82a02176e06715cd5a1.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/37fcaa616c9bf82a02176e06715cd5a1.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >선체와 선수부터 돛대, 갑판, 내부 공간에 이르기까지 배의 구석구석을 깨끗이 청소하세요. 때와 먼지로 뒤덮인 구석구석과 숨겨진 공간, 그리고 보람찬 복원 작업이 기다리는 세밀한 작업 구역을 탐험해 보세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/f7d767d1165f84071fa58b3424d5d70f.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/f7d767d1165f84071fa58b3424d5d70f.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >각기 다른 세척 방법이 필요한 소금, 녹, 그리고 잘 지워지지 않는 따개비 층을 효과적으로 제거하세요. 각 오염 물질의 특성을 파악하고, 이를 효과적으로 제거할 수 있는 최적의 방법을 선택하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/59d5181b188aba146eb0d73d5136405f.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/59d5181b188aba146eb0d73d5136405f.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >자신의 도구, 전략, 시간에 맞는 작업을 선택하여 본인의 속도에 맞춰 프로젝트를 진행하세요. 평판을 쌓고 작업장을 발전시키면서 다양한 작업을 자유롭게 수행해 나가세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/54ae80d363a5176d778c974e8ec7586c.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/54ae80d363a5176d778c974e8ec7586c.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >일하는 틈틈이 아늑한 해변가 집에서 낚시나 요리 같은 편안한 미니 게임을 즐기며 휴식을 취해 보세요. 매일 반복되는 복구 작업에서 벗어나 상쾌한 휴식을 선사하는 평화로운 해변의 순간을 만끽해 보세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>주요 특징</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ 몰입감 넘치고 세밀하게 구현된 작업 환경에서 다양한 선박을 복원하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 전문 도구와 작업장 시스템을 활용해 까다로운 복원 작업을 수행하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 보람찬 성장 시스템을 통해 작업 공간을 업그레이드하고 확장하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 다층 구조의 실내 및 야외 해안 지역에서 작업하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ 변화무쌍한 날씨, 주야간 주기, 그리고 편안한 해안가 이벤트를 경험하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >준비하세요! 그리고 'Seaside Wash'의 최신 소식과 업데이트를 놓치지 않으려면 디스코드(Discord)에 가입하는 것을 잊지 마세요!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1065e7311fde021e79b4cac1609f66ee.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/1065e7311fde021e79b4cac1609f66ee.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>‘Seaside Wash’</strong>는 몰입감 넘치는 세척 소리와 편안한 배경 음악을 조화시켜 평온하면서도 매력적인 경험을 선사합니다. 녹슬고 낡은 배들이 서서히 새것처럼 깨끗해지는 과정을 지켜보며, 작업할 때마다 성취감을 느낄 수 있습니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0064c32bed11f6cdd8ee4834dfdc1a10.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/0064c32bed11f6cdd8ee4834dfdc1a10.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >표면과 오염의 종류에 따라 필요한 도구가 다릅니다. 각 청소 작업에는 최상의 결과를 얻기 위해 적합한 장비와 방법이 필요하므로, 효율을 극대화하기 위해 신중하게 선택하십시오.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6a856c6661eac0e90d7f5e1994ae86a9.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6a856c6661eac0e90d7f5e1994ae86a9.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >도구를 업그레이드하고 수리하여 효율성을 높여, 더 까다롭지만 보람 있는 작업을 수행하세요. 복원 작업의 난이도가 높아짐에 따라 더 좋은 도구를 해금하고 작업 방식을 개선해 나가세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/3412ce03fba5ddc12f1990426e8cec94.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/3412ce03fba5ddc12f1990426e8cec94.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >작은 어선부터 거대한 화물선까지 다양한 선박을 다루게 됩니다. 각 선박은 고유한 구조와 규모를 지니고 있으며, 복원해야 할 청소 과제들이 기다리고 있습니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/37fcaa616c9bf82a02176e06715cd5a1.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/37fcaa616c9bf82a02176e06715cd5a1.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >선체와 선수부터 돛대, 갑판, 내부 공간에 이르기까지 배의 구석구석을 깨끗이 청소하세요. 때와 먼지로 뒤덮인 구석구석과 숨겨진 공간, 그리고 보람찬 복원 작업이 기다리는 세밀한 작업 구역을 탐험해 보세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/f7d767d1165f84071fa58b3424d5d70f.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/f7d767d1165f84071fa58b3424d5d70f.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >각기 다른 세척 방법이 필요한 소금, 녹, 그리고 잘 지워지지 않는 따개비 층을 효과적으로 제거하세요. 각 오염 물질의 특성을 파악하고, 이를 효과적으로 제거할 수 있는 최적의 방법을 선택하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/59d5181b188aba146eb0d73d5136405f.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/59d5181b188aba146eb0d73d5136405f.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >자신의 도구, 전략, 시간에 맞는 작업을 선택하여 본인의 속도에 맞춰 프로젝트를 진행하세요. 평판을 쌓고 작업장을 발전시키면서 다양한 작업을 자유롭게 수행해 나가세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/54ae80d363a5176d778c974e8ec7586c.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/54ae80d363a5176d778c974e8ec7586c.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >일하는 틈틈이 아늑한 해변가 집에서 낚시나 요리 같은 편안한 미니 게임을 즐기며 휴식을 취해 보세요. 매일 반복되는 복구 작업에서 벗어나 상쾌한 휴식을 선사하는 평화로운 해변의 순간을 만끽해 보세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>주요 특징</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ 몰입감 넘치고 세밀하게 구현된 작업 환경에서 다양한 선박을 복원하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 전문 도구와 작업장 시스템을 활용해 까다로운 복원 작업을 수행하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 보람찬 성장 시스템을 통해 작업 공간을 업그레이드하고 확장하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 다층 구조의 실내 및 야외 해안 지역에서 작업하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ 변화무쌍한 날씨, 주야간 주기, 그리고 편안한 해안가 이벤트를 경험하세요</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >준비하세요! 그리고 'Seaside Wash'의 최신 소식과 업데이트를 놓치지 않으려면 디스코드(Discord)에 가입하는 것을 잊지 마세요!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>",
 "short_description": "‘Seaside Wash’는 녹과 따개비에 뒤덮인 배를 청소하고 수리하여 새것처럼 복원하는 아늑한 직업 시뮬레이션 게임입니다. 도구를 업그레이드하고, 사업을 확장하며, 희귀한 물건을 발견하고, 나만의 배를 건조하고, 평화로운 해변 활동을 즐겨보세요.",
 "supported_languages": "영어, 프랑스어, 이탈리아어, 독일어, 인도네시아어, 일본어, 한국어, 폴란드어, 포르투갈어 - 브라질, 러시아어, 중국어 간체, 태국어, 중국어 번체, 튀르키예어, 베트남어",
